WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.339
Describe celebrations of religious and traditional festivals in Ghana.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.311
Festivals bring people together to remember events, express thanks and strengthen

00:00:10.311 --> 00:00:14.958
identity. The curriculum mentions Eid-ul-Fitr and Eid-ul-Adha; Christmas and Easter;

00:00:14.958 --> 00:00:20.069
and traditional festivals such as Aboakyer, Hogbetsotso, Adae and Fetu Afahye.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:25.979
Celebrations may include prayer, visits, music, stories and community gatherings.

00:00:25.979 --> 00:00:27.990
Details differ among communities.

00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:33.904
Ask a family or community member about one festival and record two activities people

00:00:33.904 --> 00:00:34.264
do.
